    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/ab62c7dc55c368232c3cba6b31227111.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span><br>Take charge of your very own holiday retreat set in the sprawling and luscious mountain-scape in this management sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/415bf9c580648a527812acf41a124bf9.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fell for wood, mine for ore, craft and smelt to build and decorate cosy cabins and relaxing glamping pods by the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/4d22475bc2e70eff99346080d9883ea4.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer holiday makers to their dream refuge to spend a week in the beautiful glades of the lake and oversee their happiness providing an unforgettable and pleasant stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take them on speedboat water-ski adventures on the great Springblue Lagoon and cook them fabulous meals at Capstone Hall - homegrown ingredients from your Farm of course! There's plenty to see and do in Mountain Retreat. Enjoy your stay!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong>Till, Plant, Water and Harvest crops and flowers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and collect wood for building and crafting.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Mounts and cart for transporting materials and Lodgers to their lodge.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish a wide variety of fish. Bake fresh bread from your harvested wheat and mill-ground flour. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Lodges and advertise and rent-out to Lodgers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ores and craft furniture and smelt weaponry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off any wolves and bears and other creatures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your lodges with furniture pre-bought and crafted. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook for lodgers at Capstone hall from a variety of recipes. Either to orders or just hand out wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers will rate their stay and leave messages and star ratings in the Town hall guestbook. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests from the games characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers participate in holiday activities such as fishing, exploring the mountains, hosting BBQ's, relaxing in hot tubs or Water skiing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canoes and speedboats help you get around quickly or take a Skycar up into the mountains. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave enabled (configurable) - no need to sleep and rest-up energy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon woodland creatures to help you cut trees, harvest crops and fast travel across the world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Trinkets from around the world and display them in your show-room!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/ab62c7dc55c368232c3cba6b31227111.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span><br>Take charge of your very own holiday retreat set in the sprawling and luscious mountain-scape in this management sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/989b114123aae7420dc4b7b7f03bc562.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/415bf9c580648a527812acf41a124bf9.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fell for wood, mine for ore, craft and smelt to build and decorate cosy cabins and relaxing glamping pods by the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/25101ddfef06371eae051198d54a9ab2.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/4d22475bc2e70eff99346080d9883ea4.webp?t=1755245507\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer holiday makers to their dream refuge to spend a week in the beautiful glades of the lake and oversee their happiness providing an unforgettable and pleasant stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.poster.avif?t=1755245507\" width=620 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.webm?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/extras/255335d1e5ff444302b892ac4d13fd8c.mp4?t=1755245507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take them on speedboat water-ski adventures on the great Springblue Lagoon and cook them fabulous meals at Capstone Hall - homegrown ingredients from your Farm of course! There's plenty to see and do in Mountain Retreat. Enjoy your stay!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong>Till, Plant, Water and Harvest crops and flowers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and collect wood for building and crafting.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Mounts and cart for transporting materials and Lodgers to their lodge.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish a wide variety of fish. Bake fresh bread from your harvested wheat and mill-ground flour. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Lodges and advertise and rent-out to Lodgers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ores and craft furniture and smelt weaponry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off any wolves and bears and other creatures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your lodges with furniture pre-bought and crafted. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook for lodgers at Capstone hall from a variety of recipes. Either to orders or just hand out wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers will rate their stay and leave messages and star ratings in the Town hall guestbook. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests from the games characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers participate in holiday activities such as fishing, exploring the mountains, hosting BBQ's, relaxing in hot tubs or Water skiing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canoes and speedboats help you get around quickly or take a Skycar up into the mountains. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave enabled (configurable) - no need to sleep and rest-up energy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon woodland creatures to help you cut trees, harvest crops and fast travel across the world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Trinkets from around the world and display them in your show-room!</p></li></ul>",
